    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκχώννῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raise a mound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>Ez.</u>
				17.17
			</span></i>:—usu. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be raised on a bank</i> or <i>mound</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πόλιος ἐκκεχωσμένης ὑψοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.138
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλιστα ἡ ἐν Βουβάστι πόλις
				ἐξεχώσθη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				137
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of a bay,
				<i>to be filled up by the deposit</i> of a river,
			v.l. ib.<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>to be removed</i>, of rubbish, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				110.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>.</div>
